 211:Marigold.cpp  **** 
 212:Marigold.cpp  ****     detune_rate_persecond  = std::pow(8.0f, vdetune) - 1.0f;
 213:Marigold.cpp  ****     detune_rate_perinterval = std::min(0.75f, detune_rate_persecond / samplerate * interval_samples
